# Atlasbound invariants

- Location RPG: discover hex tiles on move; revisits = familiarity XP.
- Persist tile IDs + mastery fields only — **never** store hex geometry.
- Tile IDs: `hex:20:{q}:{r}`; all progress belongs to the single atlas.
- Engines own domain logic; views observe `WorldController` / `TileStore`.
- Prefer conventional commits (`feat:` bumps minor on `main` release).
- Read `AGENTS.md` and `docs/` before large changes.
